# …except the suite weights at the repository root. They were tracked on the js-port line
# (phase-4b) and the reconcile onto main silently untracked them, because main's ignore list
# carries the blanket rule above. CI's parity job runs the Python reference with
# HYPHAEON_WEIGHTS=$ENGINE_DIR/model.safetensors and HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1, so a missing file is not
# a slow path, it is every reference run dying at startup (measured: 23 of 23 failed at ~2.6 s
# on veg/primaeon run 34714101215).
!/model.safetensors
REVIEW.md
parity/
